@startuml
title 05  |  Opt-in preference memory

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #37678C
  LifeLineBorderColor #A9BAC8
  ParticipantBorderColor #476782
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  ActorBorderColor #476782
  ActorBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  GroupBorderColor #91AAC0
  GroupBackgroundColor #F5F9FC
  NoteBorderColor #D7B766
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
}

actor Shopper
boundary "Streamlit UI" as UI
control "Trusted controller" as Controller
control "Preference tool" as Preferences
database "SQLite repository" as Store

Shopper -> UI: Review currency, country, and finish
Shopper -> UI: Confirm Save preferences
UI -> Controller: Record actual user-save action
Controller -> Preferences: Save allowlisted values\nwith controller confirmation
Preferences -> Preferences: Validate keys, values, and confirmation
alt Allowed fields and actual user-save action
  Preferences -> Store: Transactional validated upsert
  Store --> Preferences: Saved or write failure
  Preferences --> Controller: Actual storage outcome
else Unknown field or model-claimed consent
  Preferences --> Controller: Reject without a write
end
Controller --> UI: Show saved values or failure
UI --> Shopper: Visible storage status

== Later session or restart ==
Shopper -> UI: Open new session
UI -> Controller: Request visible defaults
Controller -> Preferences: Get preferences
Preferences -> Store: Read allowlisted values
Store --> Preferences: Stored values or unavailable
Preferences --> Controller: Validated defaults or none
Controller --> UI: Label origin and storage status
UI --> Shopper: Display defaults

== Delete or disable memory ==
Shopper -> UI: Delete saved preferences / turn memory off
UI -> Controller: Confirmed delete action
Controller -> Preferences: Remove stored values
Preferences -> Store: Delete local preference row
Store --> Preferences: Deleted or unavailable
Preferences --> Controller: Actual deletion status
Controller --> UI: Show memory status

note over Controller, Store
  Clearing the current session separately removes
  conversation, budget, exclusions, and active result.
end note
@enduml
